post-it: Icons don't open
cause: Screenshot set as wallpaper
symptoms:
	Icons don't open
checks:
	no: Desktop icons open
	yes: Wallpaper is a picture of the desktop
		shows: Display Properties calls it "prank"
	yes: Folder of icons hidden in a corner
		shows: bottom right, mostly off the screen
	no: Coloured blocks and torn lines on screen
	yes: Picture is clean
	no: High contrast colour scheme
	no: No screensaver set
	no: Folders take seconds to open
	no: Unknown program in StartUp
	no: Programs lost their .EXE
software steps:
	Open the folder in the corner
	Drag the icons to the desktop
	Change the wallpaper
